<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH SUNDAY LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH SUNDAY LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English Sunday league</p>
<p>(40 overs) cricket matches:</p>
<p>At Canterbury: Kent beat Essex by 117 runs. Kent 223-7</p>
<p>innings closed (G.Cowdrey 80, M.Ealham 50). Essex 106.</p>
<p>Old Trafford: Warwickshire beat Lancashire by 21 runs.</p>
<p>Warwickshire 219-9 innings closed (T. Penney 57, D.Ostler 53).</p>
<p>Lancashire 198-9 innings closed N.Fairbrother 79).</p>
<p>Lord's: Hampshire beat Middlesex by 16 runs. Hampshire 216-7</p>
<p>innings closed (M.Hayden 89). Middlesex 200 (J.Pooley 94 not</p>
<p>out).</p>
<p>Northampton:  Worcestershire beat Northamptonshire by two</p>
<p>wickets. Northamptonshire 207-9 innings closed. Worcestershire</p>
<p>208-8.</p>
<p>Taunton: Somerset beat Gloucestershire by 73 runs. Somerset</p>
<p>267-8 innings closed (P.Holloway 117). Gloucestershire 194</p>
<p>(M.Burns 4-39).</p>
<p>The Oval: Surrey beat Durham by seven wickets. Durham 189-9</p>
<p>innings closed (M.Roseberry 55 not out; M.Bicknell 4-58). Surrey</p>
<p>190-3 (M.Butcher 81).</p>
<p>Eastbourne: Leicestershire beat Sussex by 44 runs.</p>
<p>Leicestershire 184 (B.Smith 71). Sussex 140 (D.Williamson 5-32).</p>
</text>
